Annual Percentage Yield</strong></p><span class="-visually-hidden">3.1% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-1 ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0 ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">  </p><ul class="RichText_richText-list-unordered__sXpVj"><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Unlimited deposits and ATM withdrawals + ten withdrawals per statement cycle. <a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">About the transaction limit</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>About the transaction limit</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">About the transaction limit</strong></p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We limit certain types of withdrawals and transfers from Savings and Money Market Accounts to a combined total of 10 per statement cycle. Depending on your account type, these limited transactions include things like Online and Mobile Banking transfers (between Ally Bank accounts or to third party), Overdraft Transfer Service, checks, and point-of-sale transactions (such as debit card purchases). </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We don&#x27;t charge a fee for going over the limit. However, we&#x27;ll close your account if you exceed it on more than an occasional basis.</p></div></div></div></p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Rate is variable and may change after the account is opened</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Fees may reduce earnings</p></li></ul><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">   </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">   </p></div></div><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-no-inline__7AGiC Link_-embedded-block___x1B8" data-allytmln="viewDetailsMMA" href="/bank/money-market-account/" target="_self" aria-label="View Details">View Details</a><a class="Link_ctaOutline__Q8prV" data-allytmln="bank-moneyMarketOpenAccount" href="https://secure.ally.com/open-account/?OAP=MMDA" target="_self" aria-label="Open Money Market Account">Open Account</a></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-top__7lQIZ"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><h2 data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_h2" class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL -mt-0 -mb-xs Text_-align-center__DZFHC" tabindex="-1">Savings</h2><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">  </p></div><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-1 ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0 ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="Card_card__KHG0_ -bg-grey-200 Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-left__eCMNt Card_-align-top__7lQIZ "><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW"><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Best for:</strong> Organizing and maximizing your savings using buckets and boosters. Access your money at any time.</p></div></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">
<strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">Annual Percentage Yield</strong></p><span class="-visually-hidden">3.1% correct as of 10/08/26</span></div><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-1 ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0 ExperienceContent_-align-top__k5GPm"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-left__XlLYm RichText_-align-top__chODu"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">   </p><ul class="RichText_richText-list-unordered__sXpVj"><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Ten withdrawals per statement cycle; <a class="Modal_dialogTrigger__6C7WP Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe Link_buttonAsLink__4_bbF" role="button" href="##">About the transaction limit</a><div aria-hidden="true" class="Modal_dialogStaticContent__mO2ld"><div>About the transaction limit</div><div><div class="RichText_richText__314m4"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">About the transaction limit</strong></p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We limit certain types of withdrawals and transfers from Savings and Money Market Accounts to a combined total of 10 per statement cycle. Depending on your account type, these limited transactions include things like Online and Mobile Banking transfers (between Ally Bank accounts or to third party), Overdraft Transfer Service, checks, and point-of-sale transactions (such as debit card purchases). </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">We don&#x27;t charge a fee for going over the limit. However, we&#x27;ll close your account if you exceed it on more than an occasional basis.</p></div></div></div></p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Rate is variable and may change after the account is opened</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Unlimited deposits</p></li><li><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">Fees may reduce earnings</p></li></ul><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">   </p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs">   </p></div></div><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-no-inline__7AGiC Link_-embedded-block___x1B8" data-allytmln="viewDetailsSA" href="/bank/online-savings-account/" target="_self" aria-label="View Details">View Details</a><a class="Link_ctaOutline__Q8prV" data-allytmln="bank-onlineSavingsOpenAccount" href="https://secure.ally.com/open-account/?OAP=OSAV" target="_self" aria-label="Open Online Savings Account">Open Account</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="SectionXXL_section___e2vD  Section_-section-divider__MRjYV" id="section-2rCE60Avvx1vXfFhsSIALF"><div class="SectionXXL_sectionContainer__0qh4q"><div class="SectionXXL_sectionContent__wshFC grid-col-1"><div class="RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-top__chODu"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">What you should know</strong></p><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC">Our Annual Percentage Yields (APYs) are accurate as of <time class="EffectiveDate_effectiveDate__M3Me5">10/08/2026</time>. No minimum balance required to open an account or earn APY. Rate is variable and may change after the account is opened.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="Section_section__CRZ0c " id="section-2rF63ucUPgx2p0IGkOriAF"><div class="Section_sectionContainer__DiKn9"><h2 class="Text_heading-lg__xw3JL Text_-align-center__DZFHC Section_sectionHeading__tK95j -mb-lg" tabindex="-1">Savings Account Features</h2><div class="Section_sectionContent__bg_Qs grid-col-1 Section_-align-center__4Bqiw Section_-align-bottom__UvR90"><div class=" ExperienceContent_experienceContent__iwRdT grid-col-4 ExperienceContent_-align-left__F5Tq0 ExperienceContent_-align-bottom__HWf5X"><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs">Interest compounded daily</p></div></li></ul></div><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs">Earn a higher rate than traditional savings</p></div></li></ul></div><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs">Available to open in the name of a Trust. <a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="learnAboutTrusts" href="https://www.ally.com/go/learn/trust-account.html" target="_self" aria-label="select Learn about trusts to learn more">Learn about trusts</a></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs"><a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" href="##" data-state="closed">No monthly maintenance fees</a></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs">24/7 customer service</p></div></li></ul></div><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs"><a role="button" class="Tooltip_tooltipTrigger__u_Pda" data-allytmln="OnlineBankingSecurityGuarantee" href="##" data-state="closed">Online &amp; Mobile Security Guarantee</a></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=""><ul class="ListIcon_list__JYtaz ListIcon_list-unordered-with-icon__HwUq1"><li class="ListIcon_list-item__8oz5N ListIcon_-align-left__B_6rF"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="styles_svgIcon__UoR7M ListIcon_svgIcon__QrVFu ListIcon_-plum-800__fX8XF" width="24" height="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><image href="//secure.ally.com/acs/content/cms/images/201178/0xsu4cuk2auf/3WJEz2eEuESA0Gj0LjZJOY/99ba05fe7fc092d6b351a423f2c638ef/Size_LG__2_.png" width="24" height="24"></image></svg><div class="RichText_listItemContentWrapper__ZxnIE"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xs"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="viewMemberFDIC" href="https://www.ally.com/bank/fdic/" target="_self" aria-label="Member FDIC">Member FDIC</a></p></div></li></ul></div></div><div class="Card_card__KHG0_  grid-col-4 Card_-border-default-drop-shadow-default__uD2Gt Card_-align__f9Wol Card_-align-center__Pmfn6 Card_-align-bottom__N_51l"><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-bottom__yTtvL"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><strong data-testid="RichTextTestId_mark_bold">  More to explore:</strong></p></div><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-bottom__yTtvL"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="compareCDs" href="https://www.ally.com/bank/cd-rates/" target="_self" aria-label="Compare CD accounts">Compare CD Accounts</a></p></div><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-bottom__yTtvL"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="compareIRAs" href="https://www.ally.com/bank/ira/" target="_self" aria-label="Compare IRA accounts">Compare IRA Accounts</a></p></div><div class="Card_card-richText__dfmRW RichText_richText__314m4 RichText_-align-center__Epa5z RichText_-align-bottom__yTtvL"><p data-testid="RichTextTestId_block_p" class="Text_body-md__aYHxV -mt-0 -mb-xxs Text_-align-center__DZFHC"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="compareAllAccountTypes" href="https://www.ally.com/bank/view-rates/" target="_self" aria-label="Compare all account types">Compare All Accounts</a></p></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class="styles_footer__ec6DM"><div class="styles_socialMediaLinks__ttevQ"><a class="Link_link__JHJ4m Link_-underline__lnWRl Link_-inline__GtMVe" data-allytmln="Instagram" href="http